 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種／Walters・品種: 花後に刈り込む・刈る。MBG の「必要なら毎年株分けして締まった姿に」は条件つきで、毎年の更新が必要との明記ではないので D にしない（NC State は数年ごと）。ランナーで広がり「必要に応じて抑える」（stauden.de）は侵略的の明記ではない。機械の D から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "Plants should be clipped hard or mowed (to 2 inches) after blooming to maintain a tidy habit.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "D 毎年株更新型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "弱",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；中\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐湿性: やや弱い 高温多湿を嫌います（蒸れ 弱 相当）\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 日照 寒冷地: 日向／暖地: 乾燥した日向が理想（西日 ○ 相当）\n[MBG/種] Tends to perform poorly in climates with hot, humid sumemrs.\n[NC State/種] It does well in cool summer climates but is less successful in the high summer heat and humidity of the deep South.\n[NC State/種] Does not perform well in climates with high humidity or in a location with insufficient sunlight.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／NC State・種] Self-seeding will occur if the spent blooms are not removed.\n[地下茎 2／NC State・種] The plant spreads by underground runners and makes a good ground cover; however, it is a short-lived plant that may result in dead patches in a covered area.\n[地下茎の食い違い] MBG は 1 相当",
